  "prefLabel": "Site 102.161 Compressor station",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.161 “Compressor station” means a facility that mechanically re-pressurizes natural gas to keep the natural gas flowing continuously in a pipeline at a desired flow rate.\n\nSource. #11155, eff 8-16-16",
